+.. function:: setSoftStepSettings(substepRate, contactStiffness, contactDamping, pushSpeed)
+
+   Sets the Soft Step solver's settings (solver type 3). Only with Bullet NEXT. A value of 0.0
+   keeps that setting's default.
+
+   :arg substepRate: Substeps per second (default 540): more is stiffer and slower.
+   :type substepRate: float
+   :arg contactStiffness: Contact stiffness as a spring frequency in Hz (default: an eighth of
+      the substep rate, 67.5 at 540); at most a quarter of the substep rate is used.
+   :type contactStiffness: float
+   :arg contactDamping: Contact damping ratio (default 10): 1 and above settles without bouncing.
+   :type contactDamping: float
+   :arg pushSpeed: Fastest speed at which overlapping objects are pushed apart, in m/s (default 3).
+   :type pushSpeed: float
+
